            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two nurses in Essex are tackling absenteeism among primary school pupils by educating children and their parents about how to manage minor illnesses. The school liaison nurses provide a telephone helpline and home visits, and support with the management of chronic conditions such as asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
